This chart declares third-party charts as dependencies rather than vendoring
them. Their copyright notices and license terms stay with the archives Helm
downloads into charts/, which this repository does not commit. Chart.yaml and
Chart.lock name and pin every one of them:

    opentelemetry-kube-stack   open-telemetry/opentelemetry-helm-charts
    prometheus-node-exporter   prometheus-community/helm-charts
    metrics-server             kubernetes-sigs/metrics-server

THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md at the root of this repository indexes the notice files
for the components that build a binary, and records which components are
covered. This chart builds none, so it has no entry there.
